        {
            "name": "Verifikasi Berkas (Admin SILAU)",
            "description": "\nFR-18\u2013FR-21, FR-61, BR-13, BR-61, BR-64, BR-66, BR-74. Aturan sama dengan web (AC-30.3): Action yang sama, kanal audit \"mobile\".\nTidak ada endpoint keputusan massal; Fast Verify = keputusan satu per satu lewat endpoint yang sama (BR-74).",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "Antrean verifikasi berkas",
                    "request": {
                        "url": {
                            "host": "{{baseUrl}}",
                            "path": "api\/v1\/verifikasi-berkas",
                            "query": [
                                {
                                    "key": "periode",
                                    "value": "16",
                                    "description": "ID periode pendaftaran.",
                                    "disabled": false
                                },
                                {
                                    "key": "track",
                                    "value": "TI",
                                    "description": "Kode track.",
                                    "disabled": false
                                },
                                {
                                    "key": "peminatan",
                                    "value": "16",
                                    "description": "ID peminatan.",
                                    "disabled": false
                                },
                                {
                                    "key": "jenis",
                                    "value": "revisi",
                                    "description": "`baru` atau `revisi` (revisi masuk).",
                                    "disabled": false
                                },
                                {
                                    "key": "page",
                                    "value": "1",
                                    "description": "",
                                    "disabled": false
                                },
                                {
                                    "key": "per_page",
                                    "value": "20",
                                    "description": "1\u2013100, bawaan 20.",
                                    "disabled": false
                                }
                            ],
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}\/api\/v1\/verifikasi-berkas?periode=16&track=TI&peminatan=16&jenis=revisi&page=1&per_page=20"
                        },
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application\/json"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application\/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "body": null,
                        "description": "Pendaftaran berstatus Diajukan (tanpa Draf), urut pengajuan terlama."
                    },
                    "response": []
                },
                {
                    "name": "Detail verifikasi berkas",
                    "request": {
                        "url": {
                            "host": "{{baseUrl}}",
                            "path": "api\/v1\/verifikasi-berkas\/:pendaftaran_id",
                            "query": [],
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}\/api\/v1\/verifikasi-berkas\/:pendaftaran_id",
                            "variable": [
                                {
                                    "id": "pendaftaran_id",
                                    "key": "pendaftaran_id",
                                    "value": "architecto",
                                    "description": "The ID of the pendaftaran."
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application\/json"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application\/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "body": null,
                        "description": "Biodata (NIK tersamar), dokumen + checklist per jenis, kuota minimum peminatan. `versi` tiap dokumen dikirim kembali saat memutuskan."
                    },
                    "response": []
                },
                {
                    "name": "Keputusan per dokumen",
                    "request": {
                        "url": {
                            "host": "{{baseUrl}}",
                            "path": "api\/v1\/verifikasi-berkas\/:pendaftaran_id\/dokumen\/:dokumen_id",
                            "query": [],
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}\/api\/v1\/verifikasi-berkas\/:pendaftaran_id\/dokumen\/:dokumen_id",
                            "variable": [
                                {
                                    "id": "pendaftaran_id",
                                    "key": "pendaftaran_id",
                                    "value": "architecto",
                                    "description": "The ID of the pendaftaran."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "dokumen_id",
                                    "key": "dokumen_id",
                                    "value": 1,
                                    "description": "The ID of the dokumen."
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        "method": "PUT",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application\/json"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application\/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\"keputusan\":\"valid\",\"versi\":\"2026-11-26 03:00:00.000000\",\"kriteria\":[16],\"catatan\":\"architecto\"}"
                        },
                        "description": "Valid hanya bila semua kriteria checklist dicentang; Ditolak wajib kriteria tak terpenuhi dan\/atau catatan (A-64). Versi usang \u2192 409 `SUDAH_DIVERIFIKASI`."
                    },
                    "response": []
                },
                {
                    "name": "Selesaikan verifikasi",
                    "request": {
                        "url": {
                            "host": "{{baseUrl}}",
                            "path": "api\/v1\/verifikasi-berkas\/:pendaftaran_id\/selesai",
                            "query": [],
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}\/api\/v1\/verifikasi-berkas\/:pendaftaran_id\/selesai",
                            "variable": [
                                {
                                    "id": "pendaftaran_id",
                                    "key": "pendaftaran_id",
                                    "value": "architecto",
                                    "description": "The ID of the pendaftaran."
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application\/json"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application\/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "body": null,
                        "description": "Semua dokumen harus sudah diputuskan \u2192 Perlu Revisi (ada Ditolak) atau Masuk Kuota (semua Valid, K-42)."
                    },
                    "response": []
                }
            ]
        },
        {
